WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:02.350
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:05.490
Check it!

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.480
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.910
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:33.790
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.460
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.220
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.530
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:50.230
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.570
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:56.070
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.380
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.410
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.950
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:05.750
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.390
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:11.490
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.990
Everybody, loosey

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.500
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.900
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.270
Fly up, angel

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:46.890
Sure ain't many taxis.
That the only one?

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:49.560
All the taxis in Osaka get
in an accident or something?

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:54.070
There're so many people out at night.

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:57.670
Men <i>and</i> women are up to no
good nowadays, ya know?

00:01:57.670 --> 00:01:59.000
It's rough!

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:03.840
--Ain't you up to no good too?
--Ha! You're worse than me!

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:07.750
"D.D.D. Ultra Beast vs.
Mega Rider Dai-Osaka Dome"

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:10.080
Thank you for riding.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:12.920
Now approaching our
last stop, Dai-Osaka.

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:16.350
Note that all connecting
lines have ended for today.

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:21.690
You read that article in the paper?
Tokyo's had it bad lately!

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:23.190
How so?

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:27.700
There're loads of gun-toting
kids around Shibuya!

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:30.600
There's no telling
when you'll get shot!

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.200
Guess we got it better here, huh?

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:37.240
My oldest daughter went to a
school in Tokyo last month.

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:38.940
Sorry to hear it!

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:44.070
Seriously, she could've
gone to any other school!

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:52.880
What the...?!

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:07.430
Huh...?

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:29.790
You said no taxis would
come so a train did instead!

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:32.300
This ain't my fault, you idiot!

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:35.230
--What the heck?!
--What's going on?!

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:51.120
So then it just flew off! Huh?

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:54.420
Not my toupee, dimwit! The train!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.220
Where did Shin-<i>chan</i> go?

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:59.920
Probably girl-hunting again.
Often does it at accident scenes.

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:02.860
Assistant Inspector!

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.260
This is a real mess.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.300
Seems one of the cars
suddenly started up

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:10.770
and ran smack into the
last train of the day.

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:12.000
Just one car?

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.070
The station manager says it
wasn't scheduled to leave

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:17.730
and the conductor wasn't on board.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:22.650
That's crazy. How can a train
just start without a conductor?

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:24.220
Maybe it was a ghost?

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:28.550
Maybe the curse of someone who
jumped into a train's path...?

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:30.760
--Assistant Inspector Iriki!
--What?

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:34.830
A call for you in the
station manager's office!

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.030
Who's it from?

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:42.460
Dunno, but they said they have
info for you about the accident...

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:44.400
Alright...

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.240
Who is this?

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:52.880
Iriki-<i>han</i> of the Hanshin
Police's Tiger Unit?

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:57.520
--I hear you have some info for me?
--That's right. I have everything.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:00.080
Want something on a super bargain sale?

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:03.290
Cut the crap! Are you a
discount supermarket?!

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:06.160
Bet you were shocked, huh?

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.390
I'm busy. I'm hanging
up if this is a prank.

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:15.400
It's no prank. There was
nobody on the train, right?

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:18.070
It was a ghost. A real one.

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:21.140
Now, now. Don't mock the
discount supermarket.

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:24.440
You're gravely mistaken if
you think this is over!

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:29.140
Listen, I <i>will</i> crush the police.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:35.650
That's not all; I'll crush Osaka
itself. Look forward to it!

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:38.260
Who are you?

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:41.620
An ultra-hyper-deluxe terrorist!

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:46.860
You get a trace?

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:50.300
He used an anti-tracing EM filter...

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.240
We have a psycho on our hands.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:56.440
Obviously! Would a normal
person be a terrorist?!

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:58.110
Set up a wide-area police net!

00:05:58.110 --> 00:06:00.910
I want every suspicious
person taken in!

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:05.400
What're you doing here?

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:08.270
You don't look so friendly!
Come with us!

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:12.370
Screw you! My unfriendly
looks run in the family!

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:17.980
--It's Tetsuzo of Minami!
--You don't scare us! Hey, Stop!

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:21.580
Good morning!

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:28.810
Let's do our morning exercises!
One, two, three!

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:42.940
Welcome!

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:46.310
Please select a meal ticket and
insert it into the order box.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:49.970
Put both hands behind your
head and face this way!

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:53.650
Is eating udon a crime here?

00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:56.020
Shut up and raise your hands!

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:59.680
From Tokyo, huh?! That makes
you even more suspicious!

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:05.820
Those're some big guns you got there...

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:09.900
Oh, she's just a kid...

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:12.420
You got a license for those...?!

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:19.700
Tokyo must be mighty dangerous if
they give licenses to girls like this.

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:23.880
But fake licenses <i>are</i> common lately...

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:26.010
Sorry, but you'll have to come with us.

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:28.850
No. I have somewhere to go.

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:34.290
Where's that? I can give ya a
lift after we double-check things.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:36.690
Ever heard of D.D.D.?

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:41.060
--You're here to see D.D.D.?
--Masa-<i>yan</i>...

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:44.300
So you came all the way from Tokyo?

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:46.970
In that case, things are different.

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:50.000
I'm a huge fan myself! I'll let ya go.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:54.080
Fine. I'll overlook you for his sake.

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:59.640
All I ask is you don't wave
those big guns around too much.

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.810
--Good work. Resume your search!
--Yes, sir!

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.160
"#1: Takoyaki Parfait"

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.890
"#1: Takoyaki Parfait"
Let's see...

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:14.690
Oh, here it is!

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:16.260
Huh?!

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:20.340
That's strange. It says
they're open today...

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:23.810
Excuse me! I want a takoyaki parfait!

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.440
--Hey, you! What're you doing?!
--Scram, you moron!

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.000
Right! Sorry!

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:51.400
Get your hot dogs here!

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:55.640
At last, our holy knight Mega Rider
encounters his greatest crisis!

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:57.640
During the previous
'Super Survival G-5',

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:00.640
the evil deity Ultra Beast
suffered near-fatal injuries

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:04.770
but acquired a Dark Aura
to rise again from Hell!

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:09.550
An intense battle at full throttle!
Hurry to the battle stage!

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:12.590
Mega Rider won't lose!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:15.990
Send that lame Ultra Beast back to Hell!

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.490
Yeah!

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.430
Five minutes until we close!

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:25.060
Only three Mega Rider vs.
Ultra Beast sets left!

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:35.340
--You're late.
--I was having udon.

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:38.180
--A girl...?
--That's right.

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:42.050
--And a kid, at that!
--Would an older man have been better?

00:09:42.050 --> 00:09:45.820
--How dare you speak that way?!
--Stop!

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:50.620
I asked for someone reliable.
Not a child.

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:55.600
Fine. But since I'm here,
I'll tell you something.

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:58.930
--What's that?
--You have a rat in the ceiling.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:14.950
This is an entertainment
reporter for a weekly magazine!

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:17.780
I see! He's quite a large rat!

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:24.580
I like you! Come sit down!

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:29.200
Seems a kid was okay, after all.

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:34.590
Iron K hits Red Giant
with an explosive kick!

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:38.810
The Masked Battlers are an
important income source

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:42.440
for the western Bailan, which
supports Japan's economy.

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:45.880
But Mega Rider is the real superstar.

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:49.550
He's worth as much as
1000 thoroughbreds.

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:51.790
Comparing people with horses?

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.790
At any rate, I want you
to protect Mega Rider.

00:10:54.790 --> 00:10:57.790
It's a serious affair if
anything happens to him!

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:02.560
We've learned that the guys
behind the Dai-Osaka incident

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:04.930
are targeting this location next.

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:10.140
The Hanshin Police know this,
but don't seem to care much.

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:13.070
No matter how much we
rely on exciting events,

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:16.710
the match <i>must</i> be seen to its end.

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:21.310
--Protect Mega Rider for us.
--I just need to let the match finish?

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:25.820
The match will last 15 minutes
if all goes as scripted.

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:28.120
A simple job, wouldn't you say?

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:31.990
The time has come...

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:39.200
...for the final showdown between
good and evil, light and shadow!

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:44.930
The resurrected fiend from
Hell has challenged our hero!

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:50.010
Come forth, aboard
your holy blue smoke!

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:53.780
Holy knight, Mega Rider!

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:06.190
--Yes! It's really him!
--Totally awesome! He's flying!

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:16.370
Here he is!

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:21.040
The monster of pure evil that
changed his injuries into anger

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:23.880
to return from Hell!

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:32.050
What a huge egg!

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:36.490
Mega Rider! Turn him into
an omelet and eat him!

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:40.860
The mighty evil deity, Ultra Beast!

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.830
So bright!

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:46.030
--What the...?! I can't see!
--Help!

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:56.010
This is it. We're counting on you.

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:59.450
--What if the match goes long?
--Don't worry.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:03.710
It'll end on time if they do
it like they did in rehearsal.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:07.260
I shall send you to Hell once again!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.880
Today, you will die once and for all!

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:15.690
"I will stain this world with evil
power! You will be the sacrifice!"

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:21.330
There's the starting bell.

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:25.730
The play is on. Right?

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:48.260
Why, you...! What is that power?!

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:58.340
--He totally went flying!
--Ultra Beast got super strong!

00:13:58.340 --> 00:14:03.140
Oh, my! It's the Mega Rider
Super Dash Punch stance!

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:14.390
Come on...! Are you even serious?!

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:15.910
What's the deal?!

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:25.230
Incredible! Ultra Beast
unleashes a fierce attack!

00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:28.900
Is the special training he
underwent in Hell effective?!

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:35.500
--Mega Rider! Pull yourself together!
--He's all bashed up!

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:44.520
Hey, wasn't Mega Rider
supposed to attack

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:48.020
and send Ultra Beast outside the ring?

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:51.010
Yes. This isn't in the script.

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:58.920
When did he learn to jump like that?!

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:09.210
Why, you...!

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:13.310
It seems you've powered
up with Hell's energy,

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:16.750
but justice cannot afford to lose...!

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:26.190
Do it like we did in rehearsal!

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:29.790
Do you know what'll happen afterwards?!

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:37.530
What is that?!

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:52.420
Impossible! This wasn't in the script!

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:57.460
Whoa, he transformed!
<i>This</i> is why I love D.D.D.!

00:15:57.460 --> 00:16:03.260
But the pamphlet picture is
different. Maybe they changed it?

00:16:03.260 --> 00:16:05.500
Mega Rider! What're you scared for?!

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:07.840
Attack him back, Mega Rider!

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:10.600
I can't beat this...!

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:28.450
Mega Rider has been thrown out of
the ring and knocked unconscious!

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:35.000
No way! My Mega Rider...!

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:38.630
What kind of hero disgraces
himself like that?!

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:40.630
--Yeah!
--I want my money back!

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:42.830
You better retire tomorrow!

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:52.250
Looks like it was worth
coming to Osaka after all!

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:54.210
It's so realistic!

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:58.980
What is this?!

00:17:08.930 --> 00:17:10.870
Now it's you and me!

00:17:10.870 --> 00:17:12.670
Who's that chick?

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:15.600
Maybe there's a new
plot starting today?

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:18.700
That's it! Pulverize that monster!

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:39.160
"Showdown Today!!"

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:42.860
"Showdown Today!!"
Wish I could see it.
Bet it's going on right now...

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:43.300
"Showdown Today!!"

00:17:44.570 --> 00:17:49.570
Hanshin Poli-- Oh, Takane! What's up?

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:54.180
What?! Ultra Beast turned
into a real monster?!

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:55.970
--Let's move out!
--Right!

00:17:56.280 --> 00:18:00.650
Tiger Unit and Shark Unit.
Hurry to Dai-Osaka Dome at once!

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:01.980
I repeat--

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:08.320
Tougher than I thought!

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:11.830
The match is ruined
because of your laziness!

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:14.060
I told you to protect Mega Rider!

00:18:14.060 --> 00:18:16.530
Complain to the monster!

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:17.590
Whoops.

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:26.370
--Damn it! Do something about him!
--You rely on exciting events, don't you?

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:27.740
Why, you...!

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:29.840
Are you all right, sir?!

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:33.340
--You moron! This is your fault!
--Please calm down!

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:47.900
He's in the sewers beneath the
Midosuji Line and moving north!

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:49.160
Estimated course?

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:51.430
At this rate, he may come
out directly beneath

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:53.730
the scene of last night's accident.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:55.500
Where are you now, Takane?

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:58.210
500 meters west of Umeda Underground.

00:18:58.210 --> 00:19:00.510
I can get to the shopping center first.

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.740
Roger that. We're counting on you!

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:22.490
Didn't expect to do bug
collecting in Osaka!

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:36.070
You're as stubborn as a bug!

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:06.700
Is this one of those...?!

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.420
Shut up already!

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:40.040
Who're you?!

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:42.200
That's my line!

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:46.780
Put the guns away.

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:51.410
You can't expect to live long
jumping over people like that!

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:54.550
You gonna fight?!

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:01.800
Important material evidence
has gotten away because of you!

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:04.300
What do you have to say for yourself?!

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:06.730
Material evidence...?

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:10.190
Not to mention obstruction
of police duties!

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:12.810
What?!

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:16.340
Hanshin Police, Section 1, Hawk Unit.

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:19.750
Katsu Takane of the Independent
Investigation Team...

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:23.840
--I'm a detective, in other words!
--Takane! You all right?!

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:26.180
It's you...!

00:21:57.400 --> 00:22:05.070
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:05.070 --> 00:22:12.720
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:20.420
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:29.800
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:29.800 --> 00:22:36.340
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:36.340 --> 00:22:45.350
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:45.350 --> 00:22:52.340
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:13.380 --> 00:23:18.480
<i>A town that must be protected.
Loved ones. A heated battle...</i>

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:22.050
<i>A gigantic plot finally
unfolds! What is its true form?!</i>

00:23:22.050 --> 00:23:26.650
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Tsutenkaku Tower, Drenched with Tears"
